      "walkthrough": [
        "Express the shaded area as the difference between the two sector areas:\n$$\\text{Area} = \\frac{1}{2}(2r)^2\\alpha - \\frac{1}{2}r^2\\alpha = 30$$",
        "Substitute $\\alpha = 0.8$ into the area equation:\n$$\\frac{1}{2}(4r^2 - r^2)(0.8) = \\frac{1}{2}(3r^2)(0.8) = 1.2r^2 = 30$$",
        "Solve for $r$:\n$$r^2 = \\frac{30}{1.2} = 25 \\implies r = 5\\text{ cm}$$"
